claim.claim-text:
a transport apparatus configured to move a sample receptacle carrier, the transport apparatus comprising:
a dock comprising first and second carrier support portions, the first carrier support portion being configured to support the sample receptacle carrier, and the second carrier support portion extending from the first carrier support portion and configured to contact a portion of the sample receptacle carrier, wherein the dock is movable between a first position and a second position; and
one or more magnets coupled to the second carrier support portion, each of the one or more magnets being configured to magnetically couple with a magnetic portion of the sample receptacle carrier, thereby securing the sample receptacle carrier to the dock;

a motor;
a first pulley coupled to the motor;
a second pulley; and
a drive belt coupled to the first and second pulleys and coupled to the dock,
wherein the motor is configured to rotate the first pulley and, in turn, the drive belt, thereby moving the dock between the first position and the second position.
